<H1><EM>Research Interests</EM></H1>


<br>

I am interested in the theory, application and computation of nonlinear problems (linear problems are for cissies) with special interest in problems 
which arise in industry. 
<ul>
<li> <A HREF="https://people.bath.ac.uk/mascjb/Papers09/acta.pdf"> 
Adaptive moving mesh methods </a>, with applications in meteorology 
and modelling climate

